        "original_id": "d09e812f-bf77-543c-abb8-4c45af35f642",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People/Bands: Antix, Slayer, Lizzy Borden, Megadeth, Anthrax, Raven, Grim Reaper\n- Organizations/Publications: Hit Parader\n- Products: \"Daze Gone By\", \"The Wild Bunch\"\n\nFacts:\n- Hit Parader was an American music magazine that operated from 1942 to 2008.\n- In 1984, Antix's song \"Daze Gone By\" appeared on Hit Parader magazine's compilation album \"The Wild Bunch.\"\n- \"The Wild Bunch\" also included bands such as Slayer, Lizzy Borden, Megadeth, Anthrax, Raven, and Grim Reaper.",
